e before their energy can be fully understood.'\n6\\. Kill 1 a nullforge titan 0/1 Arcstone, Shattered Isles\n7\\. ?\n**Do NOT get rid of the colored Fragments you looted. You will have to turn them in, in the next partisan task.**\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n36 platinum\nYou gain experience!\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
