      walkthrough = "**Status: Incomplete**\n\nQuest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Arcstone, Shattered Isles [zone=1383]\n**Who:**\n- Ao, the Fourth Born [ _Story Quest 3_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 122\n**Maximum Level:** | 130\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n**Era:** | !Shattering of Ro\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Mar 25 03:34:26 2026\nModified: Wed May 20 09:26:31 2026 | | _**Ao, the Fourth Born is located on the eastern side of the 6th island in Arcstone, Shattered Isles. /waypoint -659, +1194, +1803**_\nYou say, 'Hail, Ao, the Fourth Born'\nAo, the Fourth Born says, 'The echoes... they quake, they tremble like frightened children. You must [ **find**] the elemental Resonant Crystals hidden within some of the storms to anchor their power.\nI will find the Resonant Crystals within the storms.\nAo, the Fourth Born says, 'Yes... each storm... they hold the crystals, but they do not always match the storm... No... alignment is key... Only by forcing the echoes into their proper rythm will they calm. Within the correct resonant crystal, it will work. You must [ **stabilize**] before everything unravels.'\nI will stabilize the echoes using the crystals.\nAo, the Fourth Born says, 'Also, if I may ask something... uh... rather difficult. The Scrykin... so many have been twisted by Arcstone's sundering. Their pain clings to them. You must end the [ **suffering**] of the affected Scrykin as you make your way to stabilize the Memory Echoes, or their torment will endure.'\nI will end their suffering.\nYou have been assigned the task 'The Silence of Druzzil Ro.'\nAo, the Fourth Born says, 'Tread carefully, or you'll end up like the poor wretches you chase.'\n\n---\n\n**1\\. Kill 12 vile and corrupted scrykin**\n\n---\n\n**2\\. Deliver 1 Red Memory Echo to fire resonant crystal**\n\n---\n\n**3\\. Deliver 1 Blue Memory Echo to water resonant crystal**\n\n---\n\n**4\\. Deliver 1 Green Memory Echo to earth resonant crystal**\n\n---\n\n**5\\. Deliver 1 Yellow Memory Echo to wind resonant crystal**\n\n---\n\n**6\\. Kill 3 an echo hunter**\n\n---\n\n**7\\. Deliver 1 Stable Red Memory Echo to Firiona Vie**\n\n---\n\n**8\\. Deliver 1 Stable Blue Memory Echo to Firiona Vie**\n\n---\n\n**9\\. Deliver 1 Stable Green Memory Echo to Firiona Vie**\n\n---\n\n**10\\. Deliver 1 Stable Yellow Memory Echo to Firiona Vie**\n**Submitted by:** larth ; Vilforn ; vizhip\n- Experience, Money",
