      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Arcstone, Isle of Spirits [zone=333]\n**Who:**\n- Lady Usher [ _Missions_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 65\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Armour Set\n**Quest Items:**\n- Crafting Mold: Spirit Boots [item=47504]\n- Crafting Mold: Spirit Bracers [item=47505]\n- Crafting Mold: Spirit Chest [item=47506]\n- Crafting Mold: Spirit Gloves [item=47507]\n- Crafting Mold: Spirit Helm [item=47508]\n- Crafting Mold: Spirit Leggings [item=47509]\n- Crafting Mold: Spirit Sleeves [item=47510]\n- Spirit Mark of Air [item=47085]\n- Spirit Mark of Battle [item=47045]\n- Spirit Mark of Earth [item=47511]\n- Spirit Mark of Fire [item=47086]\n- Spirit Mark of Scale [item=47512]\n- Spirit Mark of Vision [item=47088]\n- Spirit Mark of Water [item=47087]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Bristlebark [npc=20304]\n- Echo of Skylance [npc=21141]\n- Embra [npc=20300]\n- Firelash [npc=20299]\n- Seedstep [npc=21115]\n- Shekar [npc=20311]\n- Squall [npc=20632]\n- Stillsheen [npc=20310]\n- Tempest - Arcstone [npc=20322]\n- Thorn [npc=21009]\n- Willowalk [npc=21116]\n**Era:** | !Prophecy of Ro\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Fri Feb 24 00:05:30 2006\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _Lady Usher may be found outside one of the tents at the zone-in, at -200, +1685._\nYou say, 'Hail, Lady Usher'\nLady Usher says 'Greetings, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. You arrived here unannounced, as though carried in by the wind! At first I thought you were one of the spirits of this isle. Now that I see you up close, I realize you are solid and not [clouded] at the edges like they are. . .'\nYou say, 'Clouded?'\nLady Usher says 'Yes, clouded. It is difficult to explain and almost impossible to see, unless you know how to look without expectation. Essentially the spirits of this isle adopt physical bodies, but these [bodies] are transient, existing for moments at a time'\nYou say, 'What bodies?'\nLady Usher says 'When a spirit leaves its adopted body, it often leaves behind a spirit mark, in the same way we leave behind footprints. I've been studying these spirit marks since I arrived here. They can be used to forge powerful [armor].'\nYou say, 'What armor?'\nLady Usher says 'I can help you create a suit of spirit-forged armor. Here are the ingredients you must gather first.'\n_You are told to gather:_\n_Spirit Mark of Air (arms),_\n_Spirit Mark of Battle (chest),_\n_Spirit Mark of Earth (gloves),_\n_Spirit Mark of Fire (legs),_\n_Spirit Mark of Scale (wrists),_\n_Spirit Mark of Vision (helm),_\n_Spirit Mark of Water (feet)._\n_You also need a Crafting Mold for each one. The molds are purchasable from Lady Usher._\n_Bards receive Prismatic Scaled {Armor}._\n_Beastlords receive {Armor} of the Wildkin._\n_Berserkers receive Dark-Alloy {Armor} of Rage._\n_Clerics receive {Armor} of the Harmonious Soul._\n_Druids receive Woven Bramble {Armor}._\n_Enchanters receive {Armor} of Persuasion._\n_Magicians receive Elemental Essence {Armor}._\n_Monks receive {Armor} of Celestial Discipline._\n_Necromancers receive {Armor} of the Whispering Soul._\n_Paladins receive Redeemer's {Armor}._\n_Rangers receive Heartwood {Armor}._\n_Rogues receive {Armor} of Stolen Fate._\n_Shadowknights receive Hate-Cursed {Armor}._\n_Shaman receive {Armor} of the Fates._\n_Warriors receive {Armor} of the Blessed Champion._\n_Wizards receive {Armor} of Prismatic Power._\n_Hand in the appropriate mold along with the appropriate Spirit Mark to receive your class-specific reward._\n**Need all dialogues, faction hits if any, quest mobs involved, additional zones including instance names as you zone in, list of rewards, etc.**\n**Submitted by:** Siega\n- Armguards of Stolen Fate [item=47531]\n- Armguards of the Fates [item=48451]\n- Arms of the Wildkin [item=47529]\n- Armwraps of Celestial Discipline [item=48286]\n- Boots of Stolen Fate [item=47224]\n- Boots of the Blessed Champion [item=47582]\n- Boots of the Fates [item=47513]\n- Boots of the Harmonious Soul [item=48079]\n- Boots of the Wildkin [item=47135]\n- Bracer of the Blessed Champion [item=48046]\n- Bracer of the Harmonious Soul [item=47986]\n- Breastplate of the Blessed Champion [item=47583]\n- Breastplate of the Harmonious Soul [item=47140]\n- Breeches of Persuasion [item=47144]\n- Breeches of Prismatic Power [item=47796]\n- Breeches of the Whispering Soul [item=47365]\n- Cap of Celestial Discipline [item=47838]\n- Cap of the Wildkin [item=47530]\n- Coif of Stolen Fate [item=47831]\n- Coif of the Fates [item=47514]\n- Cowl of Prismatic Power [item=47571]\n- Dark Alloy Armguards of Rage [item=47978]\n- Dark Alloy Boots of Rage [item=47457]\n- Dark Alloy Gloves of Rage [item=55571]\n- Dark Alloy Leggings of Rage [item=47084]\n- Dark Alloy Linked Shirt of Rage [item=47139]\n- Dark-Alloy Coif of Rage [item=48634]\n- Dark-Alloy Wristguard of Rage [item=51044]\n- Elemental Essence Bracer [item=48217]\n- Elemental Essence Breeches [item=47177]\n- Elemental Essence Crown [item=48133]\n- Elemental Essence Robe [item=47178]\n- Elemental Essence Sleeves [item=48132]\n- Elemental Essence Slippers [item=47179]\n- Elemental Essence Wristcuff [item=47180]\n- Gauntlets of the Blessed Champion [item=48047]\n- Gauntlets of the Harmonious Soul [item=51074]\n- Gloves of Persuasion [item=51086]\n- Gloves of Prismatic Power [item=55356]\n- Gloves of Stolen Fate [item=51195]\n- Gloves of the Whispering Soul [item=50118]\n- Gloves of the Wildkin [item=47136]\n- Greaves of the Blessed Champion [item=47584]\n- Greaves of the Harmonious Soul [item=47141]\n- Handwraps of Celestial Discipline [item=51045]\n- Hate-Cursed Boots [item=47970]\n- Hate-Cursed Bracer [item=48708]\n- Hate-Cursed Breastplat