      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Arcstone, Isle of Spirits [zone=333]\n**Who:**\n- Apprentice Mage Sarcrynn [ _Missions_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 70\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Loot\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Fledgling Scrykin +?\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Quest Items:**\n- Dragon Tooth of Ashenback [item=47094]\n- Dragon Tooth of Shar`Drahn [item=47092]\n- Dragon Tooth of Tsikut [item=47090]\n- Fragment of Porthio`s Shadow Staff [item=47434]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Relic, the Artifact City [zone=343]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Ashenback [npc=20315]\n- Or`Sarro the Youngest [npc=20630]\n- Porthio the Second Born [npc=20392]\n- Shar`Drahn [npc=20316]\n- Tsikut [npc=20330]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Daosheen the Firstborn [Raid]\n**Era:** | !Prophecy of Ro\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Mar 1 06:51:37 2006\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _This is a solo task._\n_Apprentice Mage Sarcrynn may be found near the entrance to Relic at +130, -1040, but paths away to the north. He will return to his original spot after about 5 minutes._\nYou say, 'Hail, Apprentice Mage Sarcrynn'\nApprentice Mage Sarcrynn says 'All day long Ao has us wandering this blasted slope, hunting for spell components. He claims it's part of our training before we can become true mages of Relic. Bah, I think he just wants to keep us busy while he studies the [real magic].'\nYou say, 'What real magic?'\nApprentice Mage Sarcrynn says 'Ah, you want to know about the true power of the Plane of Magic then? Come closer then, let us speak more in hushed voices. I have overheard the Elder Scrykin talking of great things. . .'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Entrance to Daosheen's Chamber'.\nBring Sarcrynn the Dragon Tooth of Shar`Drahn (0/1) - Arcstone\nBring Sarcrynn the Dragon Tooth of Tsikut (0/1) - Arcstone\nBring Sarcrynn the Dragon Tooth of Ashenback (0/1) - Arcstone\nBring Sarcrynn a Fragment of Porthio's Shadow Staff (0/1) - Arcstone\nSpeak with Or`Sarro (0/1) - Arcstone\nDaosheen is the firstborn of the scrykin lineage but you won't find him anywhere on Relic. He has locked himself in the highest room in Skylance tower and he has not come out in many years. Only Druzzil knows what arcane secrets he has unriddled in there. If you seek the true magic of this plane, then you need to enter Daosheen's room.\nTo break the seal on the portal to his chamber, you need to bring me the following items from the bodies of Daosheen's lieutenants. I can use them as spell components to weaken his power and allow us both entry to his chamber. It's not right that he keeps such secrets locked away for himself.\n_After giving Sarcrynn the three teeth and staff fragment, you will need to speak with Or`Sarro at the entrance to Relic._\nYou say, 'Hail, Or`Sarro the Youngest'\n_Your task 'Entrance to Daosheen's Chamber' has been updated._\nExcellent work, my friend. While you were away, I was able to recover this scroll. I'm not sure what it proves beyond Daosheen's obvious insanity, but it may offer you some clues as to what he's been building in his study all these years. With your help, Daosheen's reign of madness will soon come to an end.\nYour faction standing with Fledgling Scrykin got better.\nYou have been given: Crystals of the Firstborn\nYou can now request the Daosheen the Firstborn raid [quest=3418].\nReward(s):\nCrystals of the Firstborn\n**Submitted by:** Saraban, Darkwind\n- Crystals of the Firstborn [item=47210]",
