      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Arcstone, Isle of Spirits [zone=333]\n**Who:**\n- Spirit of Ao the Fourth Born [npc=20290]\nRating:\n0/1**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(From 1 rating)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 70\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Loot\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Fledgling Scrykin +?\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Quest Items:**\n- The Prototype Egg of Tallongast [item=49766]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Skylance: The Oubliette [zone=386]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Arkahn [npc=29186]\n- a chest - Skylance Oubliette Task [npc=21111]\n- a mossy bone golem [npc=21686]\n- a underformed scrykin [npc=21685]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Skylance: The Laboratory [quest=3420]\n- Skylance: The Library [quest=3366]\n**Era:** | !Prophecy of Ro\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sat Apr 8 00:17:04 2006\nModified: Sun Apr 20 10:31:41 2025 | | _This group task becomes available after the 'Skylance: The Library' task is completed._\nThe Codex Artifice which you have recently recovered contains information detailing Druzzil's early attempts at creating a scrykin. During the time, Druzzil crafted the egg of Tallongast the Prototype, the entity that was to be the first scrykin. For reasons unknown, Tallongast was never hatched. According to the Codex Artifice however, Druzzil used a chime created by Ayonae Ro to be the voice of Tallongast. This may be the very chime you seek!\nEnter Skylance Tower and find the Unhatched Egg of Tallongast the Prototype. It is hidden away in the oubliette, the dungeon below Skylance where all things go that are meant to be forgotten.\nEnter Skylance Tower. (1/1) - Arcstone\nLOADING, PLEASE WAIT...\nYou have entered Skylance\nYou say \"Hail, Arkahn\".\nArkahn says \"Greetings, \\_\\_\\_\\_. I am Arkahn the Gatekeeper of Skylance. Ao has instructed me to wait here for your arrival. I cannot help you overtly, but I will serve as your guide while you remain in this tower. Tell me, where are you headed? The [oubliette]? The [library]? The [laboratory]? Or perhaps [Daosheen's study]? I can direct you to all these chambers.\nYou say, 'the oubliette'\nArkahn says 'The oubliette lies beyond the portal on this floor. Follow my familiar to the gate and be careful. The oubliette contains many forgotten magical creations, most of which are dangerous, unstable or, quite simply, not meant to see the light of day.'\nEnter the Skylance Oubliette. (1/1) - Skylance\nRecover the Egg of Tallongast the Prototype. (1/1) - Skylance\n_Each room in the Oubliette contains a cluster of pulsing eggsacks guarded by a number of low-hitting creeping swarmers. After clearing the mobs around a cluster, break eggs individually. Each egg pops a single level 71 underformed scrykin. Eventually you will find the right egg.. there will be no mob and the egg-breaker will receive the The Prototype Egg of Tallongast on their cursor._\n_The zone does repop and the task can be won on a repop as well as \"fresh\" eggsacks._\nReturn the Egg to Ao. (1/1) - Arcstone\n_A chest spawns with loot which may be the following:_\n_Battle-Forged Mace_\n_Manastitch Cape_\n_Mask of the Blessed_\n_Trash drops:_\n_Scrykin Farseer's Stone_\n_Vial of the Escaped Genie_\n- Battle-Forged Mace [item=48792]\n- Eye of Ice [item=48987]\n- Manastitch Cape [item=48806]\n- Mask of the Blessed [item=48294]\n- Scrykin Farseer's Stone [item=50504]\n- Vial of the Escaped Genie [item=50496]",
    },
